; Typical mistakes - underlined while typing, before assembling

LEDS        EQU     $FC             ; output port: bargraph

            ORG     $20
Start       LDA     #$01            ; first pattern
Loop        STA     #LEDS           ; send pattern to the LEDs
            LSLA                    next pattern
            BNE     loop            ; until all bits are through
            TFR     A,X
 Wait       NOP
            BRA     Start

            ORG     $FF
            FCB     Start
